    "what_it_does": "Reliance Industries operates across energy, petrochemicals, retail, and digital services. Its oil-to-chemicals segment sells transportation fuels and polymers to industrial and consumer markets, while its retail arm (Reliance Retail) sells consumer electronics, fashion, and FMCG products to Indian consumers through a large network of stores and online platforms. The company also provides digital services and media content to millions of users via Jio and JioStar platforms.",
