   "data": {
    "bull": [
     {
      "text": "TTM revenue of ₹1,199,033 Cr and PAT of ₹95,625 Cr with 3-year CAGR of 6.4% for revenue and 8.9% for PAT demonstrate consistent top-line and bottom-line growth.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Operating margin improved from 16.2% to 17% over three years, operating cash flow to PAT ratio of 2.07 over three years, and low debt-to-equity of 0.43 indicate strong financial health and cash generation.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Management targets Rs.80,000 Cr on O2C basis, aims to double absolute EBITDA, and has set a Rs.1 lakh Cr target for FY2030, signaling ambitious growth aspirations.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2026-11-01:p15",
       "T:2026-07-01:p23",
       "T:2026-07-01:p30"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "bear": [
     {
      "text": "ROCE of only 10% and ROE not available suggest modest returns on capital employed despite the company's large scale.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Management's key targets (Rs.80k Cr O2C, double EBITDA, Rs.1 lakh Cr by FY2030) are explicitly noted as unverified and cannot be checked from reported financials.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2026-11-01:p15",
       "T:2026-07-01:p23",
       "T:2026-07-01:p30"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Quarterly PAT shows volatility with ₹22,290 Cr (Dec 2025), ₹20,589 Cr (Mar 2026), ₹23,196 Cr (Jun 2026), and ₹29,550 Cr (Sep 2026), indicating inconsistent quarterly profitability.",
